Package: curatedBladderData
Type: Package
Title: Bladder Cancer Gene Expression Analysis
Version: 1.49.1
Date: 2026-10-06
Author: Markus Riester
Maintainer: Markus Riester <markus@jimmy.harvard.edu>
Description: Manually curated bladder cancer ExpressionSet objects from 10
    studies (12 objects, since two studies contributed data on two platforms
    each), with uniformly processed expression data and curated clinical
    metadata. Datasets are hosted on Zenodo and downloaded on first use,
    then cached locally with BiocFileCache. Includes a configurable script
    for rule-based creation of filtered dataset lists for meta-analysis.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0.0),
    Biobase
Imports:
    BiocFileCache,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    BiocStyle,
    genefilter,
    logging,
    survival,
    sva,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    xtable
License: Artistic-2.0
URL: https://github.com/lima1/curatedBladderData
BugReports: https://github.com/lima1/curatedBladderData/issues
biocViews: ExperimentData, CancerData, MicroarrayData, ExpressionData, GEO
BuildResaveData: no
Config/testthat/edition: 3
